     "message": {
      "text": "Request input becomes an argument of a fixed program run with Deno.Command. No shell parses it, but the program does: a value starting with `-` is read as an option (git's --upload-pack, ssh's -oProxyCommand, tar's --checkpoint-action run commands). Put `--` before positional values, or refuse values that begin with `-`."
     },
