      "text": "Request input decides what code runs: an eval, a Function body, the specifier of a dynamic import(), or a Worker's module URL. Deno's import() accepts https: and data: specifiers, so a chosen specifier is remote code execution with every permission the process holds, not just a choice among local modules. Map the input to a fixed set of specifiers instead."
