     "message": {
      "text": "Request input chooses where the server connects: a fetch URL, a WebSocket URL, or the host of Deno.connect / Deno.connectTls / Deno.resolveDns. The request is made from inside the network with the server's identity, so it reaches internal services and cloud metadata endpoints --allow-net does not scope out. Pin the host: parse with new URL(), compare `hostname` against an allowlist, and grant --allow-net only for those hosts."
     },
