        "text": "Request input is written into the process environment with Deno.env.set. Every child the process spawns afterwards inherits it, so a chosen LD_PRELOAD, NODE_OPTIONS, PATH or DENO_DIR runs the attacker's code, and later Deno.env.get reads trust it as configuration. Pass per-request values to a child through Deno.Command's `env` option, never the process environment."
